{#
  The header of a campaign, ONE component for the campaign page and the campaign details modal (a later task): the title ("PREFIX - Name") and the
  badges (status, reentry). A campaign has no "Updated on" line (no build date; the segment one is its last build). Same idea and same script/CSS as Segment/header.html.twig (segment-campaign-detail-badges.js
  draws the badges from the hidden marker). On the campaign page a script puts it in place of core's heading.
  Variables: title (already with the prefix), markerAttributes (escaped attributes of the marker, raw).
#}
<div class="patches-segment-header patches-campaign-header patches-modal-head patches-details-badges-host">
    <h1 class="page-header-title patches-modal-name">{{ title }}</h1>
    <span class="patches-detail-status" hidden {{ markerAttributes|raw }}></span>
</div>
